{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550240/extras/fd55a32cdfd76a4ba100c5c18d0c765b.poster.avif?t=1760968050\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550240/extras/fd55a32cdfd76a4ba100c5c18d0c765b.webm?t=1760968050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550240/extras/fd55a32cdfd76a4ba100c5c18d0c765b.mp4?t=1760968050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Void Crawler</strong> is a first-person horror game set in a dystopian future. You pilot a drilling vehicle nicknamed <i>\u201cThe Mole\u201d</i> into a mysterious underground void to extract a rare and powerful crystal for a corporation that claims it can solve the world\u2019s energy crisis.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Marcus Everett</strong>, a veteran tank operator and machinery expert, who has withdrawn from duty after the tragic loss of his 12-year-old daughter. His grief is interrupted by an unexpected call from <strong>Void Energies</strong>, offering him a lucrative contract: return to the driver\u2019s seat, and put his skills to use in exchange for a life-changing paycheck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate the darkness</strong> using The Mole\u2019s infrared camera and radar, uncovering hidden dangers and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in dread</strong> through a first-person perspective that heightens the claustrophobic atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive under pressure</strong> by managing The Mole\u2019s vital systems \u2014 battery, oil, and coolant. Extracting crystals drains your power, so timely deliveries to the dock are essential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operate heavy machinery</strong> with intense, tactile gameplay as you drill deeper into the void.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face psychological horror</strong> with hallucinations, fear, and escalating tension that test your sanity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience gritty visuals</strong> that amplify the oppressive, industrial tone of the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <i>Warning: This game contains flashing lights and visual effects that may trigger seizures in individuals with photosensitive epilepsy.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Into the Void","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2550240/e5a987852f17341f4905ff59f5bc89325faf4819.jpg"},{"name":"Have you not read the manual, son?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2550240/02e9f113fa9e4280ea20470d25c0e47581da26af.jpg"},{"name":"Inaugural Package","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2550240/31f074d062fe8891b9daa0a2c64238f3b6e90b41.jpg"},{"name":"keeping things cool","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2550240/c79d747fa5a1a2b40137ba4637466dc6d73d4f75.jpg"},{"name":"Oily Odyssey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2550240/e18888c1add2ff237c9aca2aa61388403c474beb.jpg"},{"name":"Job halfway done","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2550240/c4b1c966e7a9fa9dcf45faac4c53abb50fe89a9c.jpg"},{"name":"Just one more echo in the Abyss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2550240/5fbfeefb244d2810711c1187cdfeaef24463840b.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2550240?t=1760968050","background_raw":"h